---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="DIT Investment Memo - Quarterly Systems">

	<!-- Password Gate (client-side; placeholder password = "kidgrandma") -->
	<div id="auth-gate" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-white flex items-center justify-center">
		<div class="max-w-md w-full mx-auto px-6">
			<div class="text-center mb-8">
				<div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 mb-3">Quarterly Systems</div>
				<h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Confidential Memo</h1>
				<p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">This document is shared by invitation only.</p>
			</div>
			<form id="auth-form" class="space-y-4">
				<input
					id="auth-input"
					type="password"
					placeholder="Access code"
					autocomplete="off"
					class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-500 focus:border-transparent text-gray-900"
				/>
				<button
					type="submit"
					class="w-full bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white font-medium py-3 rounded-lg transition-colors"
				>
					Continue
				</button>
				<div id="auth-error" class="text-sm text-red-600 text-center hidden">Incorrect access code.</div>
			</form>
			<div class="mt-8 text-center">
				<a href="/" class="text-xs text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-600">← Quarterly Systems</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div id="memo-content" class="hidden">

		<nav class="bg-white border-b border-gray-200">
			<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
				<div class="flex justify-between items-center h-16">
					<div class="flex items-center">
						<a href="/" class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Quarterly Systems</a>
					</div>
					<div class="hidden md:block">
						<a href="/dit-drafts" class="text-sm text-gray-500 hover:text-purple-600 mr-4">Editorial Drafts →</a>
						<span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 px-3 py-2">Confidential · Investment Memo</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</nav>

		<!-- Hero -->
		<section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-white py-20 border-b border-gray-200">
			<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
				<div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-purple-600 mb-4">Investment Memo · May 2026</div>
				<h1 class="text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 tracking-tight">Dead Internet Theory</h1>
				<p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-8">A proposed first-money-in investment from the KmikeyM shareholder fund into Paizley Lee's Dead Internet Theory tour.</p>

				<!-- Hero image with overlay stats -->
				<div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-300 shadow-sm">
					<img src="/dit/hero.jpg" alt="Dead Internet Theory" class="block w-full h-auto" />

					<!-- Stats overlay (FLOSSK 404-card aesthetic: black panel, mono font, green accent labels) -->
					<div class="absolute inset-x-4 bottom-4 sm:inset-x-6 sm:bottom-6 md:inset-x-10 md:bottom-8 bg-black/90 rounded-md px-4 py-4 sm:px-6 sm:py-5 backdrop-blur-sm">
						<div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-x-6 gap-y-3 font-mono">
							<div>
								<div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-1" style="color:#6cff8a">Investor</div>
								<div class="text-sm sm:text-base text-white tracking-wide">KmikeyM</div>
							</div>
							<div>
								<div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-1" style="color:#6cff8a">Recipient</div>
								<div class="text-sm sm:text-base text-white tracking-wide">Paizley Lee</div>
							</div>
							<div>
								<div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-1" style="color:#6cff8a">Amount</div>
								<div class="text-sm sm:text-base text-white tracking-wide">$5,000</div>
							</div>
							<div>
								<div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-1" style="color:#6cff8a">Cap</div>
								<div class="text-sm sm:text-base text-white tracking-wide">2x ($10,000)</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- The Question -->
		<section class="py-16 bg-white">
			<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
				<div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-purple-600 mb-3">The Question</div>
				<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Should KmikeyM commit $5,000 from the shareholder fund as first money in to Dead Internet Theory?</h2>
				<p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
					KmikeyM has held the shareholder fund near-static for years, sized for redemption pressure that rarely arrives. This memo proposes deploying a small, defined-exit slug of that capital into Paizley Lee's Dead Internet Theory: a 2026 tour of in-person gaming events that responds to the cultural moment with a piece of intentional anti-algorithmic counter-programming.
				</p>
				<p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
					The structure is closer to a publishing advance than a venture investment: capital out, defined repayment from event revenue, capped return, then done. Inner mechanics under the standing <em>New Vote Terms of Engagement</em> protocol. The headline is what shareholders ratify.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Recipient -->
		<section class="py-16 bg-gray-50 border-y border-gray-200">
			<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
				<div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-purple-600 mb-3">The Recipient</div>
				<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Paizley Lee</h2>
				<div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-gray-700">
					<div>
						<div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400 mb-2">Project</div>
						<p>WORKSUCKS™ founder, online as <em>kidgrandma</em>. Producer of participatory long-form games. Dead Internet Theory is her 2026 tour: cyber-café LAN-party events as cultural counter-programming.</p>
					</div>
					<div>
						<div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400 mb-2">Tour Arc</div>
						<p>Begins with the LA proof-of-concept on May 17, 2026, followed by events in Brooklyn, NYC, and more.</p>
					</div>
					<div>
						<div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400 mb-2">Raise</div>
						<p>KmikeyM is first-money in on a larger raise. Paizley's fundraising continues.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- The Structure -->
		<section class="py-20 bg-white">
			<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
				<div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-purple-600 mb-3">The Structure</div>
				<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Two-Stage Hybrid Revenue Share</h2>
				<p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-2 max-w-3xl">Initial investment back quick, then ride along in the background.</p>
				<p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-12 max-w-3xl">All percentages are calculated on <strong class="text-gray-700">gross event revenue</strong> — total ticket and sponsor revenue before Paizley's production costs. Not net.</p>

				<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12">
					<!-- Stage 1 -->
					<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-pink-50 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-purple-200">
						<div class="flex items-center mb-4">
							<div class="w-10 h-10 bg-purple-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold mr-3">1</div>
							<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Stage 1 — Recovery</h3>
						</div>
						<div class="text-4xl font-bold text-purple-600 mb-2">25%</div>
						<div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500 mb-4">of gross revenue</div>
						<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
							From every paid event, 25% of gross flows to KmikeyM until the original $5,000 is fully recovered. Front-loaded so principal returns fast and Paizley still keeps three-quarters of every event.
						</p>
					</div>
					<!-- Stage 2 -->
					<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-cyan-50 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-blue-200">
						<div class="flex items-center mb-4">
							<div class="w-10 h-10 bg-blue-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold mr-3">2</div>
							<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Stage 2 — Ride-Along</h3>
						</div>
						<div class="text-4xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-2">10%</div>
						<div class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500 mb-4">of gross revenue</div>
						<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
							Once principal is recovered, the rate drops to 10% of gross until KmikeyM has received a 2x return ($10,000 total). Lighter touch, designed to be invisible at scale.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Terms grid -->
				<div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 border-t border-gray-200 pt-8">
					<div>
						<div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400 mb-1">Stage transition</div>
						<div class="font-semibold text-gray-900">$5,000 received</div>
					</div>
					<div>
						<div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400 mb-1">Cap</div>
						<div class="font-semibold text-gray-900">2x · $10,000 total</div>
					</div>
					<div>
						<div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400 mb-1">Trigger</div>
						<div class="font-semibold text-gray-900">First paid event</div>
					</div>
					<div>
						<div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400 mb-1">Term</div>
						<div class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Until cap or buyout</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- The Model -->
		<section class="py-20 bg-gray-50 border-y border-gray-200">
			<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
				<div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-purple-600 mb-3">The Model</div>
				<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Payback Across the 2026 Tour</h2>
				<p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-2 max-w-3xl">
					Working assumptions for gross revenue per event. These are starting numbers, not Paizley's projections — sanity-check before locking.
				</p>
				<p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-12 max-w-3xl">
					"Gross" means total ticket and sponsor revenue before any of Paizley's production costs come out. The model below calculates KmikeyM's take from gross, not from net.
				</p>

				<div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-600 mb-3 inline-block bg-purple-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-purple-200">▸ Adjust the assumed gross to model different scenarios</div>

				<!-- Event-by-event breakdown (interactive) -->
				<div class="space-y-6 mt-6">

					<!-- Event 1 -->
					<div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-200">
						<div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-3 flex-wrap gap-3">
							<div>
								<div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400 mb-1">Event 1</div>
								<div class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">June 2026</div>
							</div>
							<div class="text-right">
								<div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400 mb-1">Assumed gross</div>
								<div class="flex items-center justify-end gap-1">
									<span class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">$</span>
									<input id="gross-1" type="number" min="0" step="500" value="8000"
										class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded px-2 py-1 w-32 text-right focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-400"/>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="flex h-12 rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-gray-300 mb-2">
							<div id="seg-1-stage1" class="bg-purple-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm font-medium overflow-hidden" style="width:25%">$2,000</div>
							<div id="seg-1-stage2" class="bg-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm font-medium overflow-hidden" style="width:0%"></div>
							<div id="seg-1-paizley" class="bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-700 text-sm font-medium overflow-hidden" style="width:75%">Paizley keeps $6,000</div>
						</div>
						<div class="flex justify-between text-xs text-gray-500 flex-wrap gap-2">
							<span id="legend-1">
								<span data-variant="stage1only" class="legend-variant" style="display:inline;"><span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 bg-purple-600 rounded-sm mr-1"></span>Stage 1 · 25%</span>
								<span data-variant="stage2only" class="legend-variant" style="display:none;"><span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 bg-blue-600 rounded-sm mr-1"></span>Stage 2 · 10%</span>
								<span data-variant="both" class="legend-variant" style="display:none;"><span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 bg-purple-600 rounded-sm mr-1"></span>Stage 1 (first <span data-amt="stage1">$0</span>) <span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 bg-blue-600 rounded-sm ml-3 mr-1"></span>Stage 2 (remaining <span data-amt="stage2">$0</span>)</span>
								<span data-variant="capped" class="legend-variant text-gray-400" style="display:none;">Cap reached · no payback this event</span>
							</span>
							<span class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">KmikeyM Total Return: <span id="cum-1" class="text-purple-600">$2,000</span> <span class="text-gray-400 font-normal">/ $10,000</span></span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Event 2 -->
					<div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-200">
						<div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-3 flex-wrap gap-3">
							<div>
								<div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400 mb-1">Event 2</div>
								<div class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">August 2026</div>
							</div>
							<div class="text-right">
								<div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400 mb-1">Assumed gross</div>
								<div class="flex items-center justify-end gap-1">
									<span class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">$</span>
									<input id="gross-2" type="number" min="0" step="500" value="10000"
										class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded px-2 py-1 w-32 text-right focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-400"/>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="flex h-12 rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-gray-300 mb-2">
							<div id="seg-2-stage1" class="bg-purple-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm font-medium overflow-hidden" style="width:25%">$2,500</div>
							<div id="seg-2-stage2" class="bg-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm font-medium overflow-hidden" style="width:0%"></div>
							<div id="seg-2-paizley" class="bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-700 text-sm font-medium overflow-hidden" style="width:75%">Paizley keeps $7,500</div>
						</div>
						<div class="flex justify-between text-xs text-gray-500 flex-wrap gap-2">
							<span id="legend-2">
								<span data-variant="stage1only" class="legend-variant" style="display:inline;"><span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 bg-purple-600 rounded-sm mr-1"></span>Stage 1 · 25%</span>
								<span data-variant="stage2only" class="legend-variant" style="display:none;"><span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 bg-blue-600 rounded-sm mr-1"></span>Stage 2 · 10%</span>
								<span data-variant="both" class="legend-variant" style="display:none;"><span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 bg-purple-600 rounded-sm mr-1"></span>Stage 1 (first <span data-amt="stage1">$0</span>) <span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 bg-blue-600 rounded-sm ml-3 mr-1"></span>Stage 2 (remaining <span data-amt="stage2">$0</span>)</span>
								<span data-variant="capped" class="legend-variant text-gray-400" style="display:none;">Cap reached · no payback this event</span>
							</span>
							<span class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">KmikeyM Total Return: <span id="cum-2" class="text-purple-600">$4,500</span> <span class="text-gray-400 font-normal">/ $10,000</span></span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Event 3 -->
					<div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-200">
						<div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-3 flex-wrap gap-3">
							<div>
								<div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400 mb-1">Event 3</div>
								<div class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">September 2026</div>
							</div>
							<div class="text-right">
								<div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400 mb-1">Assumed gross</div>
								<div class="flex items-center justify-end gap-1">
									<span class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">$</span>
									<input id="gross-3" type="number" min="0" step="1000" value="15000"
										class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded px-2 py-1 w-32 text-right focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-400"/>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="flex h-12 rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-gray-300 mb-2">
							<div id="seg-3-stage1" class="bg-purple-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm font-medium overflow-hidden" style="width:3.33%">·</div>
							<div id="seg-3-stage2" class="bg-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm font-medium overflow-hidden" style="width:8.67%">$1,300</div>
							<div id="seg-3-paizley" class="bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-700 text-sm font-medium overflow-hidden" style="width:88%">Paizley keeps $13,200</div>
						</div>
						<div class="flex justify-between text-xs text-gray-500 flex-wrap gap-2">
							<span id="legend-3">
								<span data-variant="stage1only" class="legend-variant" style="display:none;"><span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 bg-purple-600 rounded-sm mr-1"></span>Stage 1 · 25%</span>
								<span data-variant="stage2only" class="legend-variant" style="display:none;"><span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 bg-blue-600 rounded-sm mr-1"></span>Stage 2 · 10%</span>
								<span data-variant="both" class="legend-variant" style="display:inline;"><span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 bg-purple-600 rounded-sm mr-1"></span>Stage 1 (first <span data-amt="stage1">$2,000</span>) <span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 bg-blue-600 rounded-sm ml-3 mr-1"></span>Stage 2 (remaining <span data-amt="stage2">$13,000</span>)</span>
								<span data-variant="capped" class="legend-variant text-gray-400" style="display:none;">Cap reached · no payback this event</span>
							</span>
							<span class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">KmikeyM Total Return: <span id="cum-3" class="text-purple-600">$6,300</span> <span class="text-gray-400 font-normal">/ $10,000</span></span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Events 4+ (sandbox row for cap-not-yet-hit scenarios) -->
					<div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-dashed border-gray-300">
						<div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-3 flex-wrap gap-3">
							<div>
								<div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400 mb-1">Events 4+</div>
								<div class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Future events</div>
								<div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Combined gross of any events after Event 3, in case the cap isn't hit yet.</div>
							</div>
							<div class="text-right">
								<div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400 mb-1">Combined gross</div>
								<div class="flex items-center justify-end gap-1">
									<span class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">$</span>
									<input id="gross-4" type="number" min="0" step="1000" value="37000"
										class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded px-2 py-1 w-32 text-right focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-400"/>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="flex h-12 rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-gray-300 mb-2">
							<div id="seg-4-stage1" class="bg-purple-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm font-medium overflow-hidden" style="width:0%"></div>
							<div id="seg-4-stage2" class="bg-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm font-medium overflow-hidden" style="width:10%">$3,700</div>
							<div id="seg-4-paizley" class="bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-700 text-sm font-medium overflow-hidden" style="width:90%">Paizley keeps $33,300</div>
						</div>
						<div class="flex justify-between text-xs text-gray-500 flex-wrap gap-2">
							<span id="legend-4">
								<span data-variant="stage1only" class="legend-variant" style="display:none;"><span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 bg-purple-600 rounded-sm mr-1"></span>Stage 1 · 25%</span>
								<span data-variant="stage2only" class="legend-variant" style="display:inline;"><span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 bg-blue-600 rounded-sm mr-1"></span>Stage 2 · 10%</span>
								<span data-variant="both" class="legend-variant" style="display:none;"><span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 bg-purple-600 rounded-sm mr-1"></span>Stage 1 (first <span data-amt="stage1">$0</span>) <span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 bg-blue-600 rounded-sm ml-3 mr-1"></span>Stage 2 (remaining <span data-amt="stage2">$0</span>)</span>
								<span data-variant="capped" class="legend-variant text-gray-400" style="display:none;">Cap already reached · no payback this row</span>
							</span>
							<span class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">KmikeyM Total Return: <span id="cum-4" class="text-green-600">$10,000</span> <span class="text-gray-400 font-normal">/ $10,000 · CAP</span></span>
						</div>
					</div>

				</div>

			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Buyout Option -->
		<section class="py-20 bg-white">
			<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
				<div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-purple-600 mb-3">The Escape Valve</div>
				<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Prepay Buyout, Anytime</h2>
				<p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-8">
					At any point, Paizley can clear KmikeyM off her books by paying the difference between cumulative payments received and the $10,000 cap. The deal closes immediately, no further revenue share owed.
				</p>
				<p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-8">
